                    p.lead.mb-4
                        | I’m a mobile developer working mainly on iOS, with the rest of my time across Flutter and POS and retail systems. At Solo I worked on white‑label iOS apps and iPad kiosk software for F&amp;B brands; after the product was acquired by Foodics in 2022, I kept contributing to their mobile apps in Swift and Flutter.
